IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-MULTI-LORA-ZMM-TORUS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TORUS-X             PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TORUS-Y             PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 TORUS-Z             PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-ZMM-TORUS.
    IF TORUS-X == 0 OR TORUS-Y == 0 OR TORUS-Z == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 57800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TORUS-X.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
